  {"a": "Ethelred the Unready", "e": "The payment was called Danegeld, and it was collected from the people as a tax.", "p": "Which English king paid silver to the Vikings to keep the peace?", "s": "vikings", "w": ["Edgar the Peaceful", "Edward the Elder", "Harold Harefoot"]},
  {"a": "The Thing", "e": "Iceland's Althing began about the year 930 and still meets today.", "p": "What was the Viking assembly of free men called?", "s": "vikings", "w": ["The Council", "The Senate", "The Moot"]},
  {"a": "A berserker", "e": "The English word 'berserk' comes straight from these warriors.", "p": "What was a Viking warrior who fought in a wild rage called?", "s": "vikings", "w": ["A housecarl", "A thrall", "A jarl"]},
  {"a": "Valhalla", "p": "Where did Norse warriors hope to go after dying in battle?", "s": "vikings", "w": ["Niflheim", "Midgard", "Asgard"]},
