  {"a": "A surcoat", "e": "It kept the sun off the metal and showed his colours in the crush of battle.", "p": "What was the cloth coat a knight wore over his armour?", "s": "castles_knights", "w": ["A mantle", "A tunic", "A cape"]},
  {"a": "Heraldry", "p": "What is the study of shields and family symbols called?", "s": "castles_knights", "w": ["Cartography", "Calligraphy", "Astrology"]},
  {"a": "The stirrup", "p": "Which riding invention helped a knight fight firmly on horseback?", "s": "castles_knights", "w": ["The bridle", "The spur", "The rein"]},
