  {"a": "The mechanical clock", "e": "Early ones had no hands at all, and simply struck a bell on the hour.", "p": "Which new kind of clock appeared on town towers in the 1300s?", "s": "towns_guilds", "w": ["The water clock", "The sand clock", "The sundial"]},
