  {"a": "To shout the news", "e": "Most people could not read, so news arrived by voice in the street.", "p": "What was the main job of a medieval town crier?", "s": "towns_guilds", "w": ["To ring the church bell", "To guard the town gate", "To collect the market tax"]},
  {"a": "Champagne", "e": "Merchants from Italy and Flanders met there, and the fairs ran in turn all year.", "p": "Which French region held Europe's great trade fairs in the 1100s?", "s": "towns_guilds", "w": ["Normandy", "Burgundy", "Brittany"]},
